---
description: Multplx broker operating contract for Cursor CLI
alwaysApply: true
---

Read root `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` before changing the broker contract or shared tracked material.
The primary broker dispatches through Multplx and never through Cursor subagents, background agents, or Cursor-owned worktrees.
Keep Cursor sandboxing enabled; never use `--force`, `--yolo`, or `--sandbox disabled` for routine work.
Run `bin/mx-session-start.sh` exactly once at session start when the tracked session hook instructs it.
